# app: whatsapp
# P6-4: Home Assistant cannot be reached and nothing is saved: the error state with Retry; Wi-Fi back, Retry works.
wifi off
restart
wait 2500               # long enough for the settle pass of the footer, whenever the worker's answer lands
shot inbox-error
wifi on
tap 270 628             # Retry
wait 1500
shot inbox-error-retried
